  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="30.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 30.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And æt ðam oðran cyrre ne sy ðær ne oþer bot, gyf he ful wurðe, buton ðæt man ceorfe him ða handa oððe ða fǽt óf oððe ægðer, be ðam ðe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And on the second occasion, if he is proved guilty, there shall be no compensation possible to him but to have his hands or his feet cut off or both, according to the nature of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And æt þam oðrum cyrre ne si þær nan oðer bót, gif he fúl wurðe, butan þæt man ceorfe him ða handa oððe ða fet oððe ægþer, be þam ðe seo dæd sig.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
